# test/sql 下只跟踪 .test：落盘测试写出来的 HTML 之类产物一律忽略。
# 顺序要紧 —— 最后一条规则生效，所以 `!` 必须写在 `*` 之后。
#
# Only .test files are tracked under test/sql; artefacts such as the HTML a persistence test writes are
# ignored. Order matters — the last matching rule wins, so the `!` line has to come after the `*`.
test/sql/*.*
!test/sql/*.test


/*.html

